<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Remove Disease</h1>
<p>Sphere: Poison Sphere
Class: Healer (guild level 11), Paladin (guild level 20), Druid (guild level 25)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast remove disease &lt;target&gt;
</pre>
<p>Cures the target of plague, madness or poison ivy. Against a strong disease, 
your spell must be strong too: it works if it has at least half the power of 
the spell that caused the disease.
</p><p>You must be standing. It is also found on potions, scrolls and staffs. For 
poison, see <a cmd='#'>Help Remove Poison</a>.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Plague</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Madness</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Poison Ivy</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Remove Poison</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Poison Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>